Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 19:30:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] alibabacloud: confirm instance absence after deletion errors

A concurrent cleanup can remove an instance before another caller receives
its deletion error. Read that exact instance after a failed deletion and
accept only InvalidInstanceId.NotFound as proof of absence. Preserve all
other errors and handle non-SDK errors without a type-assertion panic.

This change applies to the existing instance deletion path and requires
no data-disk support or additional DescribeDisks permission.

